00:33:05.930 --> 00:33:09.970
What do you mean by I can't come? This is an emergency!

00:33:10.550 --> 00:33:12.050
Yes, and this too.

00:33:14.080 --> 00:33:18.630
Are Starscream's rogues on the track, Bumblebee?

00:33:18.750 --> 00:33:20.170
They're nibbling on Jet's breakfast.

00:33:20.770 --> 00:33:24.940
I don't like the idea that Megatron gets the anti-materia formula.

00:33:25.440 --> 00:33:26.580
I don't trust him!

00:33:30.640 --> 00:33:31.600
He didn't fall for it either.

00:33:32.020 --> 00:33:33.880
And that goes for you too.

00:33:34.200 --> 00:33:35.990
They make a lot of money out of it.

00:33:36.770 --> 00:33:41.880
This time Prime and Braun can't help you.

00:33:43.970 --> 00:33:49.320
I thought you were Terminus Autobots.

00:33:49.620 --> 00:33:52.150
Maybe we could have helped Prime anyway.

00:34:19.750 --> 00:34:21.770
Decepticons are coming to steal the anti-matter.

00:34:22.830 --> 00:34:27.460
Anti-matter formula, I want them.

00:34:41.070 --> 00:34:43.110
Thank you very much.

00:35:03.676 --> 00:35:04.396
streak.

00:35:33.770 --> 00:35:34.450
This is...

00:35:34.450 --> 00:35:34.930
P.

00:35:36.910 --> 00:35:37.370
T.

00:35:37.370 --> 00:35:42.970
The Autobot.

00:35:45.740 --> 00:35:49.420
You are Chip Chase, don't worry.

00:35:50.180 --> 00:35:51.680
I have everything under control.

00:35:52.000 --> 00:35:59.820
I will now receive you from the...

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:03.440
Of course, Chip. You look like a central computer brain.

00:36:04.100 --> 00:36:06.770
Thank you, Prowl. I'll do my best.

00:36:07.050 --> 00:36:09.530
Keep it up. We're a great team.

00:36:10.920 --> 00:36:12.610
Before he escapes!

00:36:13.520 --> 00:36:14.920
Not so fast, guys.

00:36:16.140 --> 00:36:20.790
Oh, I hope I can do this.

00:36:21.120 --> 00:36:24.350
Do you have my order to do this?

00:36:24.550 --> 00:36:25.220
You'll see.

00:36:35.532 --> 00:36:38.772
If they're scared of this, there's something waiting for them.

00:36:41.324 --> 00:36:44.044
People, to my Electro-Heart in Pilsen!

00:37:01.530 --> 00:37:04.020
This is a decent computer. For a human being.

00:37:04.160 --> 00:37:10.730
That material formula on the track.

00:37:11.270 --> 00:37:14.760
The formula is stored in a computer outside.

00:37:15.140 --> 00:37:18.600
I pass the data through, get the formula and bring it here immediately.

00:37:24.030 --> 00:37:25.090
Wewage, get up.

00:37:25.410 --> 00:37:26.530
Mission, get the formula.

00:37:31.150 --> 00:37:37.850
No, Decepticons! The formula is in my head, so if I destroy this, the Decepticons won't be able to make antimatter anymore!

00:37:38.920 --> 00:37:43.860
Too late, Ravage! The information has been destroyed!

00:37:50.150 --> 00:37:51.350
Excellent, Ravage.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:01.460
I didn't think we'd end up here.

00:38:02.620 --> 00:38:03.680
To get some chips!

00:38:10.230 --> 00:38:13.680
And if you try to get something stupid out of it, your friend will get it.

00:38:15.010 --> 00:38:17.290
Even if they don't do anything, you're lost!

00:38:31.340 --> 00:38:32.180
That's my plan!

00:38:32.590 --> 00:38:36.480
Human being!

00:38:36.720 --> 00:38:40.480
Did you think you could hide the formula in your primitive brains?

00:38:45.000 --> 00:38:47.210
The wall in our possession, Megatron.

00:38:47.390 --> 00:38:50.750
But you can't use our knowledge for renewal, that's... wrong!

00:38:51.530 --> 00:38:53.600
The boy from the road!

00:38:53.860 --> 00:38:56.140
The time has come to make anti-matter!

00:38:57.300 --> 00:38:59.060
There is my home.

00:39:00.860 --> 00:39:03.080
Sorry boss, I just finished making it.

00:39:03.670 --> 00:39:08.590
So where was I? I mean, I have holographic brothers.

00:39:08.910 --> 00:39:12.520
Good, we start operation anti-matter.

00:39:12.860 --> 00:39:14.220
And be careful.

00:39:16.190 --> 00:39:20.870
I've never seen that before.

00:39:21.660 --> 00:39:22.080
Stop it.

00:39:23.980 --> 00:39:25.460
Who said that?

00:39:31.920 --> 00:39:35.220
There is no one. I would have a power failure in my detectors.

00:39:35.860 --> 00:39:38.080
That's the smartest thing you've ever said.

00:39:39.780 --> 00:39:42.560
Really? Hey, what's going on here?

00:39:43.520 --> 00:39:46.240
Now Soundwave activates the main computer.

00:39:47.360 --> 00:39:56.360
The material has been brought forward.

00:39:58.390 --> 00:39:59.970
That's what I'm going to do for the rest of my life.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:14.710
I will bring you maximum power!

00:40:14.850 --> 00:40:20.120
And I have ordered to clear that boy!

00:40:22.180 --> 00:40:23.850
Do you see that?

00:40:27.130 --> 00:40:27.730
Hey! Hey!

00:40:30.320 --> 00:40:31.280
Turn it off!

00:40:31.460 --> 00:40:44.730
You see, if you come with me, you'll be short of money!

00:40:46.170 --> 00:40:48.890
Now, to the track of Rustikasmaja!

00:40:49.070 --> 00:40:52.910
Okay, boys. Turn right with your cylinders.

00:41:01.400 --> 00:41:02.360
They can't escape!

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:30.620
I'm Dima.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:01.000
He's coming back for repair.

00:42:01.600 --> 00:42:03.560
Hotel Bots, transform!

00:42:08.150 --> 00:42:29.820
This is the power of the...

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:34.340
Anti-matter energy blocks, I'll powder them into dust molecules.

00:42:35.080 --> 00:42:46.400
That's a big sale!

00:42:49.650 --> 00:42:55.330
Look at that, guys.

00:42:55.750 --> 00:42:58.740
It's a sensitive connection.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:05.380
It's all my fault. If Ron had never mastered that formula, I wouldn't have learned it from the outside.

00:43:06.160 --> 00:43:10.660
Chip, you could have wiped your brain out. By the way, I can use it more efficiently.

00:43:11.740 --> 00:43:15.480
I'm working on a project and you two can help me.

00:43:16.130 --> 00:43:26.370
I totally understand.

00:43:43.120 --> 00:43:45.020
They've spotted us, they're coming for us.

00:43:49.570 --> 00:43:50.930
Tell them what's waiting for us.

00:43:51.070 --> 00:43:52.360
We have to be stopped.

00:43:53.220 --> 00:43:54.420
They're the only ones who can do that.

00:43:54.580 --> 00:43:58.550
I hate that we're done with them.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:01.280
It's about time they were built properly.

00:44:08.170 --> 00:44:21.440
This one!

00:44:39.560 --> 00:44:44.280
Jet, you don't call me a day.

00:44:59.610 --> 00:44:59.970
Soutable.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:03.640
I transform now and become the most powerful weapon in the universe!

00:45:09.290 --> 00:45:11.070
In half a second, yes!

00:45:32.270 --> 00:45:35.310
No, no...

00:45:35.310 --> 00:45:36.310
No, no, no, no, no...

00:45:36.400 --> 00:45:42.300
This is Prime.

00:45:43.700 --> 00:45:44.200
Okay, Prime.

00:46:00.440 --> 00:46:04.760
You little coward! You're not a party for SkyWarm!

00:46:04.920 --> 00:46:05.660
Pike!

00:46:10.770 --> 00:46:16.620
You worm! I'll make you the first one to do Wheeljack's inventions!

00:46:17.830 --> 00:46:23.510
Name completed. New target.

00:46:31.470 --> 00:46:33.540
It wasn't me, it was him!

00:46:33.620 --> 00:46:36.020
Did you see that?

00:46:36.930 --> 00:46:39.370
Dylan has the reflexes out of control.

00:46:39.810 --> 00:46:43.210
And my antimatter reaches the level of burning heat.

00:46:43.810 --> 00:46:46.450
I have to get rid of them before I'm destroyed.

00:46:47.950 --> 00:46:58.280
And Ingwert will destroy us!

00:47:00.120 --> 00:47:02.080
Decepticons! Retreat!

00:47:03.220 --> 00:47:19.880
I know that for sure!

00:47:20.260 --> 00:47:25.700
You might not be a car-bot, but as you were there, I would have believed it.

00:47:25.920 --> 00:47:28.540
We are proud of such a friend as you to have us here.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:33.140
A little boy took over the reign of the universe.

00:47:34.380 --> 00:47:37.160
But soon I will break free.

00:47:38.060 --> 00:47:40.220
A victory will be mine!

00:47:41.020 --> 00:47:51.960
Freaking dangerous weapons to fight the greatest threat the world has ever known.

00:47:52.740 --> 00:47:57.510
Bad, super powerful robots.

00:47:58.720 --> 00:47:59.640
Decepticons!

00:48:02.010 --> 00:48:05.980
If we try to increase our production, Chip, we can make twice as many weapons.

00:48:07.520 --> 00:48:08.520
Try it, sir.

00:48:30.440 --> 00:48:31.560
Goldman, Sector!

00:48:35.880 --> 00:48:38.660
So-

00:49:05.500 --> 00:49:10.260
Found nothing, Optimus Prime? Do you know where the next space bridge for the Decepticons is?

00:49:10.860 --> 00:49:18.140
Fear not, Ironheart. I have scanned the area where the bridge stops first, but found nothing.

00:49:18.800 --> 00:49:21.850
We can better go back to the head, Prime.

00:49:25.160 --> 00:49:29.580
An emergency signal! Conchip J is in the weapon factory. Decepticon attack!

00:49:36.200 --> 00:49:51.630
I'm afraid I didn't get enough of your buttons.

00:49:53.050 --> 00:49:57.760
Shut the fuck up!

00:50:00.320 --> 00:50:06.620
Here Megatron, bring reports from the Velvorder Starscream.

00:50:07.020 --> 00:50:08.640
I've already booked a full success.

00:50:10.060 --> 00:50:12.830
There you can see where the factory belongs.

00:50:14.790 --> 00:50:20.980
If I have the new coordinates for the space bridge, then we will transfer them to Cider.

00:50:32.010 --> 00:50:33.810
I knew the Autobots would help us!

00:50:34.070 --> 00:50:36.400
Team S'Prime!

00:50:37.160 --> 00:50:39.130
Well done!

00:50:39.710 --> 00:50:42.260
You are with Zendriën against Prime!

00:50:42.660 --> 00:50:44.820
Form one group and destroy him!

00:50:45.320 --> 00:50:46.180
With pleasure!

00:50:49.940 --> 00:50:51.200
Sook, I'm coming with you!

00:50:51.960 --> 00:50:54.200
Are you okay?

00:50:54.360 --> 00:50:59.380
Be positive, but I will Prime!

00:51:00.440 --> 00:51:09.270
You messed up the cracker, but I'll get it!

00:51:10.070 --> 00:51:12.340
You're wrong again, Skywarp!

00:51:13.180 --> 00:51:15.150
Optimus, Optimus!

00:51:44.810 --> 00:51:48.640
There is no way out!

00:51:56.540 --> 00:51:58.400
Wake them up in the pa-

00:51:59.320 --> 00:51:59.740
What the f-

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:04.860
Not Ironhide! You have to help Optimus Prime!

00:52:06.730 --> 00:52:07.360
What's wrong with you?

00:52:08.150 --> 00:52:16.010
Heavy hit. Loss of speed. Wheeljack. Can you repair me?

00:52:16.390 --> 00:52:19.130
I hope so, but not here. Can you transform me?

00:52:19.470 --> 00:52:20.470
I'm trying.

00:52:24.010 --> 00:52:29.960
Trolley. Dumped. Movement limited. Reception under threat.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:39.580
No, he's going to...

00:52:40.440 --> 00:52:42.620
Don't be so sad, your Optimus will make it.

00:52:43.160 --> 00:52:44.100
He has to!

00:53:05.330 --> 00:53:09.270
He has been set. We saw him from...

00:53:09.270 --> 00:53:13.800
Are you sure that his laser core is unplugged?

00:53:14.400 --> 00:53:15.560
You must be sure.

00:53:16.320 --> 00:53:18.520
Soundwave, activate Laserbeak.

00:53:19.910 --> 00:53:21.030
Laserbeak, transform.

00:53:21.850 --> 00:53:29.560
And, do as it should.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:31.160
Optimus Prime is.

00:53:31.520 --> 00:53:35.390
I think that Laserbeak is afraid.

00:53:35.970 --> 00:53:38.990
If he doesn't obey, he has nothing else and no fear.

00:53:39.570 --> 00:53:44.140
If Optimus Prime's laser cannon is really blown out...

00:53:44.140 --> 00:53:46.620
...we will destroy those damned Autobots.

00:53:48.140 --> 00:53:52.590
And then no one will stand our revenge of the universe in the way.

00:54:10.360 --> 00:54:10.980
It doesn't look good.

00:54:12.300 --> 00:54:17.660
What's your diagnosis, Regis?

00:54:17.800 --> 00:54:20.360
It's a miracle that such a hydraulic system still works.

00:54:21.000 --> 00:54:23.420
Weak. Electro...

00:54:24.500 --> 00:54:25.020
...delayed.

00:54:25.220 --> 00:54:28.340
It's going on. I know it. I feel it in my database.

00:54:28.900 --> 00:54:29.260
Oh, sir!

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:32.420
We have to be able to do something, right dad?

00:54:33.160 --> 00:54:34.060
I don't know, son.

00:54:34.360 --> 00:54:36.340
Now I'm there, I'll finish him off!

00:54:36.840 --> 00:54:41.640
What is it?

00:54:42.000 --> 00:54:50.240
Miss Lady is just a reaction in Optimus Prime.

00:54:50.720 --> 00:54:52.600
I'll crush everyone!

00:55:02.200 --> 00:55:11.310
Everyone still soothes, quickly loses energy.

00:55:11.850 --> 00:55:14.320
I don't want it anymore!

00:55:15.550 --> 00:55:17.820
We still have time for his powerful

00:55:17.820 --> 00:55:18.520
We still have time for his powerful

00:55:18.520 --> 00:55:19.040
We still have time for his powerful

00:55:19.040 --> 00:55:21.220
Not enough! If I can't replace this...

00:55:21.220 --> 00:55:26.880
Nitro! I have one extra! But not here!

00:55:27.510 --> 00:55:29.970
Ehm, tell me where I can get it...

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:34.020
That's not how easy it is, Bubble Bee. The Cosmitron I'm talking about is in my old workshop.

00:55:35.340 --> 00:55:36.300
On Cybertron.

00:55:36.720 --> 00:55:37.200
Cybertron?

00:55:37.540 --> 00:55:41.720
And what makes it even worse, the Decepticons have put a computer lock on the door.

00:55:42.600 --> 00:55:44.900
I knew it was hopeless. I knew it.

00:55:45.080 --> 00:55:49.980
We have a computer genie that can launch us through that door.

00:55:51.600 --> 00:55:53.840
I think I've just registered as a locksmith.

00:55:54.380 --> 00:55:58.060
Well, what are we waiting for? I always wanted to go to another planet.

00:56:03.230 --> 00:56:06.010
Optimus Prime as leader, the Autobots are powerless.

00:56:06.550 --> 00:56:09.700
Why don't we attack them now, boss?

00:56:10.000 --> 00:56:12.240
That's usually a good strategy.

00:56:12.880 --> 00:56:16.360
We attack when I command, Starscream.

00:56:17.160 --> 00:56:19.020
Hello, Shockwave, do you copy?

00:56:21.160 --> 00:56:22.540
Hiya, Megatron.

00:56:22.840 --> 00:56:25.060
When can the space bridge work again?

00:56:25.460 --> 00:56:29.720
Within 72 billion astroseconds on this coordinate.

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:33.700
Send a visual presentation.

00:56:34.600 --> 00:56:36.500
Excellent job, babe.

00:56:37.100 --> 00:56:40.100
But how do we get on time on Cybertron, boy?

00:56:40.760 --> 00:56:44.660
Prime didn't find out anything about the location of the space bridge.

00:56:44.920 --> 00:56:48.040
But Optimus Prime doesn't use the best detective on Earth.

00:56:48.710 --> 00:56:49.530
Teletraan One.

00:56:49.790 --> 00:56:54.150
If I can pass on all information about the previous space bridge to Teletraan One...

00:56:54.150 --> 00:56:57.470
...then he might be able to predict where the next one will appear.

00:56:58.190 --> 00:56:59.970
Hey, that looks like a short film.

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:01.200
I'm a horse with floppy disks!

00:57:01.800 --> 00:57:04.450
Get out of here, Teletraan!

00:57:04.790 --> 00:57:06.130
Time is running out!

00:57:07.270 --> 00:57:18.430
Careful with those blocks, Rumble!

00:57:18.770 --> 00:57:19.910
Unhandy, Jaapie!

00:57:20.170 --> 00:57:22.860
Hey, who's unhandy here? Rubber?

00:57:23.400 --> 00:57:25.620
My talent is wasted on this project!

00:57:26.020 --> 00:57:28.070
I should have the leadership of everything!

00:57:32.560 --> 00:57:35.610
Hey, do you think someone will need this stuff to get over the bridge?

00:57:36.150 --> 00:57:36.970
That's right!

00:57:37.870 --> 00:57:39.130
No, please!

00:57:39.870 --> 00:57:41.270
Not me! No!

00:57:45.990 --> 00:57:48.800
Get rid of us on Cybertron!

00:58:35.280 --> 00:58:35.880
It's better this way!

00:58:35.920 --> 00:58:47.920
These sensors are stoned!

00:58:57.900 --> 00:58:58.480
Dude, don't start!

00:59:00.220 --> 00:59:01.660
This will wake you up!

00:59:01.860 --> 00:59:09.720
A sad saying for the zealous eye

00:59:09.720 --> 00:59:14.380
The rain brings me an idea

00:59:14.960 --> 00:59:16.670
Let the wood win

00:59:17.230 --> 00:59:18.600
Do what I say!

00:59:37.960 --> 00:59:39.660
Open the main quarter for new orders!

01:00:38.160 --> 01:00:43.740
Hopeless, Megatron bewildered, Cybertron is in danger!

01:00:44.720 --> 01:00:47.820
Destroy the invaders with rain, sour rain!

01:00:52.260 --> 01:00:55.120
Don't give up, I know you can do it!

01:00:55.200 --> 01:00:56.620
This is our last chance!

01:01:00.250 --> 01:01:04.190
Chip, as with detectors, that Cosby thing now, but find!

01:01:04.950 --> 01:01:08.840
Was that fast enough?

01:01:09.160 --> 01:01:14.440
We bring this toy to Optimus!

01:01:14.740 --> 01:01:22.160
Sour rain that comes in our circus, we are lost!

01:01:23.540 --> 01:01:24.480
And Optimus Prime...

01:01:32.040 --> 01:01:33.380
Missile action

01:01:33.380 --> 01:01:47.390
End of the round

01:01:48.310 --> 01:01:49.730
Is this the beginning?

01:01:50.730 --> 01:01:52.130
Everything goes according to my plan

01:01:52.760 --> 01:01:55.400
Autobots are without a leader

01:01:55.400 --> 01:01:59.630
And four of them are defeated on Cybertron

01:02:00.600 --> 01:02:05.020
Then I propose that we attack their base now!

01:02:06.080 --> 01:02:08.810
For once, Starscream, I agree.

01:02:09.690 --> 01:02:12.790
And I will personally lead the attack.

01:02:12.890 --> 01:02:16.590
The Decepticons will become the new rulers of the universe!

01:02:19.900 --> 01:02:23.080
It's funny, Wheeljack.

01:02:23.340 --> 01:02:25.420
We can't do more, Sparkplug.

01:02:25.520 --> 01:02:29.460
Optimus Prime needs a new Cosmitron, and if we don't have that quickly, then...

01:02:38.800 --> 01:02:39.940
No one will stop us now!

01:02:42.010 --> 01:02:49.340
The power, the Miss Prime, our world, the whole universe depends on it!

01:02:49.720 --> 01:02:54.810
Luck, chip, sour rain, sick wheeze, done!

01:02:56.160 --> 01:02:59.410
If you have courage, Bumblebee, then we will surely succeed!

01:03:08.600 --> 01:03:19.590
Do I have enough strength to protect us against that sour rain?

01:03:20.050 --> 01:03:21.490
Move forward, Trailbreaker.

01:03:21.790 --> 01:03:24.370
Now you can automatically fix the repair system.

01:03:25.590 --> 01:03:29.070
While they're working, I'll take care of the rainmakers.

01:03:38.330 --> 01:03:42.360
I'm much better now, as if I just came off the treadmill.

01:03:43.320 --> 01:03:46.280
Good, don't talk anymore. Now we have to save Optimus.

01:03:46.600 --> 01:03:49.300
Transform and ride for his life.

01:03:49.820 --> 01:03:58.310
Bad muscles, I'll free us.

01:04:02.010 --> 01:04:06.420
His back, they will never reach the earth if you work the mechanisms.

01:04:07.620 --> 01:04:28.420
We still have to get Optimus Prime.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:31.220
How fast can you, Bumblebee?

01:04:31.400 --> 01:04:39.390
Sorry Spike, but sometimes you can't help it at all.

01:04:39.390 --> 01:04:41.270
Is Optimus Prime dead?

01:04:42.170 --> 01:04:44.930
Teletraan One is giving alarm signals, we're being attacked!

01:04:46.740 --> 01:04:48.520
Decepticons! It looks like they're all here!

01:04:49.000 --> 01:04:53.020
We're lost! Without Optimus Prime we can never defeat the Decepticons!

01:04:54.160 --> 01:04:56.320
We have to get rid of them!

01:04:56.320 --> 01:04:59.760
Who would have wanted this? Whatever happens...

01:05:02.170 --> 01:05:04.020
Do you want to join me or do I have to deal with them?

01:05:04.440 --> 01:05:05.540
John, you can't do that!

